# Static headers for the published treasury page.
# Cloudflare Pages and Netlify both read this file; other hosts ignore it harmlessly.
#
# The page is a financial record, so it is locked down to exactly what it needs: its own
# inline script and style, the webfont, and nothing else. No external script can run here
# even if one were somehow injected into the markup.
#
# __CSP_NOTE__ — script-src carries a hash of the page's own script, written at publish
# time by scripts/publish-treasury.mjs. Editing the script without republishing will break
# the page, which is the intended failure: the header and the page ship together.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: __CSP__
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, must-revalidate
